item.ws:crystal_magic.name=Magic Crystal
item.ws:crystal_magic.desc=The iridescent colors of this crystal seem to slowly shift and swirl, hinting at a magical energy within. Perhaps this magic could be harnessed, somehow...
item.ws:crystal_fire.name=Fiery Crystal
item.ws:crystal_fire.desc=A crystal that glows a fiery orange. Maybe it is the key to unlocking the element of fire...
item.ws:crystal_ice.name=Icy Crystal
item.ws:crystal_ice.desc=A crystal with a cold, bluish tint. Perhaps it holds the secrets to the power of frost...
item.ws:crystal_lightning.name=Stormy Crystal
item.ws:crystal_lightning.desc=A crystal that seems to swirl and flash with a chaotic energy. Maybe it hides a greater power within...
item.ws:crystal_necromancy.name=Dark Crystal
item.ws:crystal_necromancy.desc=A crystal with a deep, purplish appearance that seems to draw you in. Perhaps it is a gateway to something darker...
item.ws:crystal_earth.name=Verdant Crystal
item.ws:crystal_earth.desc=A crystal patterened with a great many greens and browns. Perhaps it holds a connection to the forces of nature...
item.ws:crystal_sorcery.name=Mystical Crystal
item.ws:crystal_sorcery.desc=A crystal that glimmers with a bluish-green light. Maybe it conceals the secrets of an ancient force...
item.ws:crystal_healing.name=Radiant Crystal
item.ws:crystal_healing.desc=A crystal that glints a golden yellow in the sunlight. Perhaps it possesses the link to a divine power...
item.ws:spell_book.desc=A book filled with the runes and glyphs of an ancient script. Perhaps with dedication, one might be able to decipher its contents...\n\nRight-click while holding this book to read it.
item.ws:spell_book.new=Not yet discovered!
item.ws:spell_book.apply_to_wizard=Replaced %1$s's spell %2$s with %3$s
item.ws:ruined_spell_book.name=Ruined Spell Book
item.ws:ruined_spell_book.desc=The pages of this tattered spell book are too damaged to be read properly, but somehow, you feel there is still magic left within it - if only it could be restored...
item.ws:arcane_tome.name=Tome of Arcana
item.ws:arcane_tome.desc=Upgrades any %1$s wand with sufficient progression to %2$s tier
item.ws:wizard_handbook.name=The Wizard's Handbook
item.ws:wizard_handbook.author=by %1$s
item.ws:wizard_handbook.desc=Your not-so-pocket-sized guide to the arcane arts! A must-have for any aspiring wizard who seeks to learn the secrets of magic.\n\nRight-click while holding this book to read it.
