entity.ws:wizard.greeting_0=Good day, fellow wanderer.
entity.ws:wizard.greeting_1=Greetings, traveller. What brings you here?
entity.ws:wizard.greeting_2=Ah, nice to see another person around here.
entity.ws:wizard.speech_0=Might I interest you in any spells, perhaps?
entity.ws:wizard.speech_1=Magic is everywhere, if you know where to look.
entity.ws:wizard.speech_2=There is still much to be learned about the arcane arts, adventurer.
entity.ws:wizard.speech_3=Perhaps you have learned something yourself that you wish to share?
entity.ws:wizard.speech_4=Studying the arcane is most fascinating, don't you think?
entity.ws:wizard.farewell_0=Good luck in your quest, adventurer.
entity.ws:wizard.farewell_1=I trust that we will meet again soon, friend.
entity.ws:wizard.farewell_2=Goodbye then, traveller.
entity.ws:wizard.combat_0=Be gone, foul creatures!
entity.ws:wizard.combat_1=Leave me alone, pests!
entity.ws:wizard.combat_2=Undead beings are not welcome here, shoo!
entity.ws:wizard.combat_3=Away with you, creatures of darkness!
entity.ws:wizard.combat_4=This is all I need! Get out of here, monsters!
entity.ws:wizard.combat_5=Return to the caves from whence you came, evil creatures!
entity.ws:wizard.player_combat_0=You will regret that decision, traveller!
entity.ws:wizard.player_combat_1=What do you think you are doing?!
entity.ws:wizard.player_combat_2=Only a fool dares to anger a wizard!
entity.ws:wizard.player_combat_3=You will pay for your carelessness, adventurer!
entity.ws:wizard.player_combat_4=Be ready to defend yourself, villain!
entity.ws:wizard.player_combat_5=Prepare to feel my wrath!
