spell.ws:agility.desc=Grants the caster faster movement speed and greater jump height for 30 seconds.
spell.ws:arc.desc=Fires a spark of lightning at the target.
spell.ws:black_hole.desc=Tear reality asunder.
spell.ws:blink.desc=Teleports the caster over a short distance to where they are pointing.
spell.ws:chain_lightning.desc=Fires a spark of lightning at the target, which then chains to additional targets up to twice.
spell.ws:charge.desc=Causes the caster to charge rapidly in the direction they are looking, damaging and knocking back anything in their path.
spell.ws:conjure_sword.desc=Creates a spectral sword of equal strength to an iron sword that lasts for 60 seconds.
spell.ws:cure_effects.desc=Removes all potion effects currently affecting the caster, good or bad.
spell.ws:darkvision.desc=Grants the caster night vision for 45 seconds.
spell.ws:decay.desc=Creates a patch of decay on the ground which infects any creature that touches it, causing lingering damage over time and spreading more decay wherever it walks.
spell.ws:earthquake.desc=A true master of earth magic can move mountains.
spell.ws:fangs.desc=Summons a row of evoker fangs in front of the caster that rise from the ground, biting mobs in their path.
spell.ws:fireball.desc=Launches a fireball in the direction you are pointing.
spell.ws:firebolt.desc=Shoots a jet of fire a short distance in front of you.
spell.ws:fire_resistance.desc=Grants the caster fire resistance for 30 seconds.
spell.ws:fire_sigil.desc=Places a magical fire trap on the ground which damages and sets on fire the creature that triggers it.
spell.ws:fireskin.desc=Cloaks the caster in flames for 30 seconds, causing anything that attacks them to catch fire.
spell.ws:flame_ray.desc=Creates a stream of flames in the direction you are pointing which sets on fire and continually damages targets.
spell.ws:forcefield.desc=Creates a forcefield around the caster which repels creatures and deflects projectiles.
spell.ws:freeze.desc=Freezes the target for 10 seconds. Will also freeze water and create snow on the ground.
spell.ws:frost_ray.desc=Creates a stream of frost in the direction you are pointing which slows and continually damages targets.
spell.ws:frost_sigil.desc=Places a magical ice trap on the ground which damages and freezes the creature that triggers it.
spell.ws:frost_step.desc=Allows the caster to freeze water as they walk for 30 seconds.
spell.ws:grapple.desc=Shoots a magical vine which allows the caster to grapple towards blocks or reel in entities. Release the use item button to let go of the block or entity.
spell.ws:greater_heal.desc=Heals the caster by 4 hearts.
spell.ws:heal.desc=Heals the caster by 2 hearts.
spell.ws:heal_ally.desc=Heals the target by 2 and a half hearts.
spell.ws:healing_aura.desc=Creates a zone of healing energy which regenerates the health of any ally inside it. Any undead inside the healing aura will slowly take damage.
spell.ws:ice_age.desc="You shall be frozen for an eternity!"
spell.ws:ice_shard.desc=Fires a shard of ice in the direction you are pointing which damages and slows targets when hit.
spell.ws:ice_shroud.desc=Creates a shroud of cold around the caster for 30 seconds, causing anything that attacks them to be frozen.
spell.ws:ice_spikes.desc=Causes razor-sharp ice spikes to rise from the ground where you are pointing, skewering any creatures caught amongst them.
spell.ws:ignite.desc=Sets the target on fire for 10 seconds. Also works like a flint and steel.
spell.ws:invisibility.desc=Makes the caster invisible for 30 seconds.
spell.ws:leap.desc=Causes the caster to jump upwards several blocks and slightly forward.
spell.ws:wind_step=Wind Step
spell.ws:wind_step.desc=Hurls you the way you are looking on a gust of air, shoving aside anything in the way. It does not pass through walls.
item.ws:spell_book_wind_step.name=Spell Book: Wind Step
item.ws:scroll_wind_step.name=Scroll: Wind Step
spell.ws:gust=Gust
spell.ws:gust.desc=Looses a cone of air in front of you. It does little harm, but shoves hard whatever stands in the way.
item.ws:spell_book_gust.name=Spell Book: Gust
item.ws:scroll_gust.name=Scroll: Gust
spell.ws:life_drain.desc=Creates a stream of withering energy in the direction you are pointing which drains the life of the target and uses it to gradually regenerate your health.
spell.ws:light.desc=Creates a magical point of light which illuminates the surrounding area. Lasts for 30 seconds.
spell.ws:lightning_bolt.desc=Causes lightning to strike where you are pointing.
spell.ws:lightning_hammer.desc="I smite you by the wrath of the heavens!"
spell.ws:lightning_pulse.desc=Charges the ground around the caster with lightning, damaging and repelling nearby creatures.
spell.ws:lightning_ray.desc=Creates a stream of lightning in the direction you are pointing which continually damages targets.
spell.ws:lightning_sigil.desc=Places a magical lightning trap on the ground which damages the creature that triggers it and chains lightning to other nearby creatures.
spell.ws:magic_missile.desc=Fires a bolt of magical energy in the direction you are pointing.
spell.ws:meteor.desc=Some wizards just want to see the world burn...
spell.ws:mind_trick.desc=Confuses and disorients the target for 15 seconds, rendering it unable to attack effectively. The effect will be dispelled if the target takes damage.
spell.ws:mine.desc=Breaks the block the caster is looking at. Potency will allow harder blocks to be broken.
spell.ws:phase_step.desc=Teleports the caster a short distance in front of them, including through walls. Range upgrades will increase the wall thickness you can teleport through.
spell.ws:plague_of_darkness.desc=The darkness will consume them all...
spell.ws:poison.desc=Fires poison in the direction you are pointing.
spell.ws:replenish_hunger.desc=Replenishes the caster's food level by 3 hunger points.
spell.ws:resurrection.desc=With a master healer by your side, being dead is... optional.
spell.ws:ring_of_fire.desc=Creates a ring of fire around the caster, damaging all nearby enemies and setting them on fire.
spell.ws:satiety.desc=Replenishes the caster's food level by 8 hunger points.
spell.ws:snare.desc=Sets a trap on the ground which damages and briefly slows the creature that triggers it.
spell.ws:snowball.desc=Launches a snowball in the direction you are pointing.
spell.ws:summon_lightning_wraith.desc=Summons a lightning wraith to fight for you. The lightning wraith will disappear after 30 seconds or if it is killed.
spell.ws:summon_skeleton.desc=Summons a skeleton to fight for you. The skeleton will disappear after 30 seconds or if it is killed.
spell.ws:summon_zombie.desc=Summons a zombie to fight for you. The zombie will disappear after 30 seconds or if it is killed.
spell.ws:thunderbolt.desc=Shoots a bolt of thunder which knocks back targets.
spell.ws:tornado.desc=Tears a whirlwind out of the ground where you are aiming. It walks forward on its own, and anything it catches is swept up into the funnel and carried along until the storm dies out.
spell.ws:transportation.desc=Transports the caster to their remembered stone circle. To use this spell, make a circle of stones of transportation, then right click it with a wand.
spell.ws:ward.desc=Grants the caster a shielding effect that reduces incoming magic damage for 30 seconds.
spell.ws:water_breathing.desc=Allows the caster to breathe underwater for 60 seconds.
spell.ws:wither.desc=Fires a ray of darkness which withers anything it touches.
spell.ws:wither_skull.desc=Launches a wither skull in the direction you are pointing.
spell.ws:invoke_weather.sun=The rain begins to stop...
spell.ws:invoke_weather.rain=The heavens open...
