config.ws.players_move_each_other=Players Move Each Other
config.ws.players_move_each_other.tooltip=Whether to allow players to move other players around using magic.
config.ws.players_move_each_other.true=Yes - let the games begin!
config.ws.players_move_each_other.false=No - I won't be pushed around
config.ws.player_block_damage=Player Block Damage
config.ws.player_block_damage.tooltip=Whether spells cast by players can destroy blocks in the world. Wizardry makes every attempt to respect protection mods and plugins, but cannot guarantee it will work in all cases for every mod. If you need absolutely watertight anti-grief, disable this setting. (N.B. This setting only affects players. To prevent mobs from destroying blocks with magic, use the mobGriefing gamerule.)
config.ws.player_block_damage.true=Yes - kaboom!
config.ws.player_block_damage.false=No - activate anti-grief (TM)
config.ws.dispenser_block_damage=Dispenser Block Damage
config.ws.dispenser_block_damage.tooltip=Whether spells cast by dispensers can destroy blocks in the world. Wizardry makes every attempt to respect protection mods and plugins, but cannot guarantee it will work in all cases for every mod. If you need absolutely watertight anti-grief, disable this setting.
config.ws.damage_type_per_element=Damage Type Per Element
config.ws.damage_type_per_element.tooltip=Whether damage should be registered with the old system (wizardry_magic/indirect_wizardry_magic) prefixed damage with the elements like necromancy_indirect_wizardry_magic, necromancy_wizardry_magic. This is disabled by default to not break existing modpacks. The intention of this setting is to allow differentiating various damage types for e.g. the Distinct Damage Descriptions mod
config.ws.single_use_spell_books=Spell Books Are Consumed By Wands
config.ws.single_use_spell_books.tooltip=Whether spell books are consumed when they are bound to a wand.
config.ws.prevent_binding_same_spell_twice_to_wands=Prevent Binding The Same Spell To A Wand Multiple Times
config.ws.prevent_binding_same_spell_twice_to_wands.tooltip=Whether to prevent binding the same spell to a wand multiple times
config.ws.mana_per_shard=Mana Per Crystal Shard
config.ws.mana_per_shard.tooltip=The amount of mana a crystal shard is worth.
config.ws.mana_per_crystal=Mana Per Crystal
config.ws.mana_per_crystal.tooltip=The amount of mana each magic crystal is worth.
config.ws.grand_crystal_mana=Grand Crystal Mana
config.ws.grand_crystal_mana.tooltip=The amount of mana a grand magic crystal is worth.
config.ws.upgrade_stack_limit=Upgrade Stack Limit
config.ws.upgrade_stack_limit.tooltip=The maximum number of one type of wand upgrade which can be applied to a wand.
config.ws.non_elemental_upgrade_bonus=Non-Elemental Upgrade Bonus
config.ws.non_elemental_upgrade_bonus.tooltip=The bonus amount of wand upgrades that can be applied to a non-elemental wand.
config.ws.siphon_mana_per_level=Siphon Mana Per Level
config.ws.siphon_mana_per_level.tooltip=The amount of mana given for a kill for each level of siphon upgrade.
config.ws.condenser_tick_interval=Condenser Tick Interval
config.ws.condenser_tick_interval.tooltip=The number of ticks between each mana increase for wands with the condenser upgrade.
config.ws.base_spell_slots=Base Spell Slots
config.ws.base_spell_slots.tooltip=The number of spell slots a wand has with no attunement upgrades applied.
config.ws.telekinetic_disarmament=Telekinetic Disarmament
config.ws.telekinetic_disarmament.tooltip=Whether to allow players to disarm other players using the telekinesis spell. Disable to prevent stealing of items.
config.ws.telekinetic_disarmament.true=Yes - let people steal things
config.ws.telekinetic_disarmament.false=No - that's cheating!
config.ws.teleport_through_unbreakable_blocks=Teleport Through Unbreakable Blocks
config.ws.teleport_through_unbreakable_blocks.tooltip=Whether players are allowed to teleport through unbreakable blocks (e.g. bedrock) using the phase step spell.
config.ws.teleport_through_unbreakable_blocks.true=Yes - I wish to see the void!
config.ws.teleport_through_unbreakable_blocks.false=No - bedrock is impenetrable
config.ws.world_time_manipulation=World Time Manipulation
config.ws.world_time_manipulation.tooltip=Whether players are allowed to change the world time with the speed time spell. If disabled, the speed time spell will not change the world time but will still speed up nearby block, entity and tile entity ticks.
config.ws.world_time_manipulation.true=Yes - daytime, nighttime...
config.ws.world_time_manipulation.false=No - I need my sleep!
config.ws.creative_bypasses_arcane_lock=Bypass Arcane Lock
config.ws.creative_bypasses_arcane_lock.tooltip=Determines which players can bypass arcane locks.
config.ws.creative_bypasses_arcane_lock.true=Anyone in creative mode
config.ws.creative_bypasses_arcane_lock.false=Only ops in creative mode
config.ws.slow_time_affects_players=Slow Time Affects Players
config.ws.slow_time_affects_players.tooltip=Whether players are slowed when another nearby player uses the slow time spell. If this is disabled, mobs and projectiles will still be affected but players will move at normal speed.
config.ws.bonemeal_grows_crystal_flowers=Bonemeal Grows Crystal Flowers
config.ws.bonemeal_grows_crystal_flowers.tooltip=Whether using bonemeal on grass blocks has a chance to grow crystal flowers.
config.ws.wands_must_be_held_to_decrement_cooldown=Wands Must Be Held To Decrement Cooldown
config.ws.wands_must_be_held_to_decrement_cooldown.tooltip=Whether wands only decrement their cooldowns if a player holds them.
config.ws.cooldown_reduction_per_level=Cooldown Reduction Per Level
config.ws.cooldown_reduction_per_level.tooltip=The fraction by which cooldowns are reduced for each level of cooldown upgrade.
config.ws.potency_increase_per_tier=Potency Increase Per Tier
config.ws.potency_increase_per_tier.tooltip=The fraction by which potency is increased for each tier of matching wand. May cause extreme lag with high values!
config.ws.duration_increase_per_level=Duration Increase Per Level
config.ws.duration_increase_per_level.tooltip=The fraction by which spell duration is increased for each level of duration upgrade.
config.ws.range_increase_per_level=Range Increase Per Level
config.ws.range_increase_per_level.tooltip=The fraction by which spell range is increased for each level of range upgrade. May cause extreme lag with high values!
config.ws.blast_increase_per_level=Blast Increase Per Level
config.ws.blast_increase_per_level.tooltip=The fraction by which spell blast is increased for each level of blast upgrade. May cause extreme lag with high values!
config.ws.frost_slowness_increase_per_level=Frost Slowness Increase Per Level
config.ws.frost_slowness_increase_per_level.tooltip=The fraction by which movement speed is reduced per level of frost effect.
config.ws.storage_increase_per_level=Storage Increase Per Level
config.ws.storage_increase_per_level.tooltip=The fraction by which maximum charge is increased for each level of storage upgrade.
