ws.hb.e.welcome.name=Welcome
ws.hb.e.welcome.body=§fWelcome to the arcane world!\n\nThis handbook gathers everything a wizard needs to know. Use the tabs above to change subject, and pick an entry on the left to read it.\n\n§fWhere to begin:\n§6- §fCraft an Initiate Wand and an Arcane Loom.\n§6- §fLook for Spell Books in chests out in the world.\n§6- §fBind your spells at the Loom and keep the wand topped up with mana.
ws.hb.e.first_steps.name=First Steps
ws.hb.e.loom.name=The Arcane Loom
ws.hb.e.robes.name=Robes & Armour
ws.hb.e.scrolls.name=Spells & Scrolls
ws.hb.e.scrolls.body=§fMagic reaches the world in two forms:\n\n§fSpell Books (permanent):\n§6- §fFound in chests in dungeons, temples, ancient cities and strongholds.\n§6- §fHold the book and use it to learn the spell for good.\n§6- §fOnce learned, you can bind it to any wand at the Loom as often as you like.\n\n§fScrolls (single use):\n§6- §fCarry one pre-written spell, for emergencies.\n§6- §fAnyone can use them, even without holding a wand.\n§6- §fUse it to cast the spell at once. The scroll is consumed.\n§6- §fCraft them by combining a Blank Scroll with magical items.
ws.hb.e.fire.name=Ignes (Fire)
ws.hb.e.fire.body=§fThe most destructive and explosive element of magic.\n\n§fSpecialities:\n§6- §fFireballs and Flame Missiles that set targets alight.\n§6- §fFirestorms and Meteors for area destruction.\n§6- §fProtective buffs: Fire Resistance and Flaming Skin.\n\n§fRecommended wand: Wand of Blazing Flames, 30% mana discount on Fire spells.
ws.hb.e.ice.name=Glacies (Ice)
ws.hb.e.ice.body=§fThe element of extreme cold, crowd control and tactical defence.\n\n§fSpecialities:\n§6- §fIce Shards and Glacial Spears with high piercing power.\n§6- §fDeep Freeze and severe Slowness against groups.\n§6- §fIce Walls and temporary Protective Barriers.\n\n§fRecommended wand: Wand of Eternal Frost, 30% mana discount on Ice spells.
ws.hb.e.lightning.name=Fulgur (Lightning)
ws.hb.e.lightning.body=§fThe element of blinding speed and chained damage.\n\n§fSpecialities:\n§6- §fInstant lightning called down from the sky.\n§6- §fArcs and Chain Lightning that jump between enemies.\n§6- §fSummoned storms and short-range electric pulses.\n\n§fRecommended wand: Wand of the Storm, 30% mana discount on Lightning spells.
ws.hb.e.earth.name=Terra (Nature)
ws.hb.e.earth.body=§fThe element of plant life, telluric forces and beasts.\n\n§fSpecialities:\n§6- §fPoison darts, thorns and webs to hold and wear down enemies.\n§6- §fEarthquakes and hurled rocks with heavy impact.\n§6- §fNatural buffs: Night Vision, Oakflesh and physical Strength.\n\n§fRecommended wand: Wand of Gaia, 30% mana discount on Earth spells.
ws.hb.e.life.name=Sanatio (Life)
ws.hb.e.life.body=§fThe element of healing, sacred protection and purifying light.\n\n§fSpecialities:\n§6- §fFast Healing, Regeneration and Group Healing for allies.\n§6- §fSevere damage against the undead: Zombies, Skeletons, the Wither.\n§6- §fProtective shields and the removal of curses and poison.\n\n§fRecommended wand: Wand of the Dawn, 30% mana discount on Healing spells.
ws.hb.e.shadow.name=Umbra (Necromancy)
ws.hb.e.shadow.body=§fThe element of decay, darkness and command over souls.\n\n§fSpecialities:\n§6- §fContinuous Decay damage and the Wither effect.\n§6- §fLife Drain: steal vitality from targets to heal the caster.\n§6- §fSummon undead minions to fight at your side.\n\n§fRecommended wand: Wand of Shadows, 30% mana discount on Necromancy spells.
ws.hb.e.sorcery.name=Arcanum (Sorcery)
ws.hb.e.sorcery.body=§fDirect manipulation of raw magical energy, space and gravity.\n\n§fSpecialities:\n§6- §fFast teleportation (Blink) and Phase Step.\n§6- §fArcane Magic Missiles and gravitational Black Holes.\n§6- §fTemporary conjuring of weapons, bows and magical tools.\n\n§fRecommended wand: Wand of Cosmic Ether, 30% mana discount on Sorcery.
ws.hb.e.crystals.name=Crystals & Mana
ws.hb.e.dust.name=Spectral Dust
ws.hb.e.dust.body=§fSpectral Dust is pure arcane energy in powdered form, used for infusion and synthesis.\n\n§fGetting it:\n§6- §fDefeating arcane remnants and entities around the world.\n§6- §fGrinding: put any Magic Crystal on a workbench to grind it into 4 Spectral Dusts of that element.\n\n§fSynthesis and infusion:\n§6- §f4 Crystal Shards + 1 Dust = 1 Magic Crystal.\n§6- §fNeutral Spectral Dust + Elemental Crystal = the matching Elemental Dust.\n§6- §f4 Dusts of one element + 1 Neutral Crystal = 1 Elemental Crystal.\n\n§fCrystal alchemy lets you convert energy between elements without hunting for new ore.
ws.hb.tab.recipes=Recipes
ws.hb.e.first_steps.body=§fTo begin your magical journey you need three things:\n\n§f1. A Wand: your channel for raw power.\n\n§f2. The Arcane Loom: the bench where you bind spells to a wand and recharge its mana.\n\n§f3. Spell Books: found in chests around the world, they teach you new spells.\n\n§fThe Recipes tab shows how to craft each of them.\n\n§fWand Tiers:\n§6- §fInitiate Wand (500 mana)\n§6- §fWeaver's Wand (1000 mana)\n§6- §fChanneler's Wand (1800 mana)\n§6- §fArchmage Wand (3000 mana)\n\n§fElemental Wands:\nThere are 7 elemental wands, 1500 mana each. They cut mana cost by 30% for spells of their own element.\n\n§fControls:\n§6- §fUse: cast the spell in the selected slot.\n§6- §fSneak + Use: cycle through the wand's 5 slots.
ws.hb.e.loom.body=§fThe Arcane Loom is the main workbench of any wizard. The Recipes tab shows how to craft it.\n\n§fBinding a spell to a wand:\n1. Hold the wand in your main hand.\n2. Use the Arcane Loom placed on the ground.\n3. Pick one of the wand's 5 slots.\n4. Choose the element and the spell you have unlocked.\n5. The spell stays in that slot until you replace it.\n\n§fYou can also use the Loom to recharge a wand's mana at any time.
ws.hb.e.robes.body=§fWizards do not wear iron or diamond. They wear robes woven from Magical Silk.\n\n§fThe set:\n§6- §fWizard Hat\n§6- §fWizard Robes\n§6- §fWizard Leggings\n§6- §fWizard Boots\n\n§fCrafting:\n1. Spin Magical Silk - the Recipes tab shows how.\n2. Craft the pieces at a workbench using the silk.\n3. Combine them with Elemental Crystals to get the matching elemental robes.\n\n§fSet Bonus:\nWearing the full 4-piece set grants passive effects and elemental affinity with your spells.
ws.hb.e.crystals.body=§fMana is the raw energy behind every spell in the arcane world.\n\n§fGetting crystals and mana:\n§6- §fMagic Crystal Ore: generates underground in caves.\n§6- §fMagic Crystals: dropped by that ore, or found in dungeon chests.\n§6- §fMana Flasks: crystals packed around a glass bottle, in Small, Medium and Large. See the Recipes tab.\n§6- §fCrystal Flowers: rare natural sources of mana on the surface.\n\n§fRecharging:\nAt the Arcane Loom, press 'Recharge Mana'. It spends flasks or crystals from your inventory to refill the wand you are holding.\n\n§fTip:\nRecharging an Elemental Wand with crystals of its own element gives an extra 300 mana per crystal.
