ws.hb.e.r_wand.body=§fYour first channel for raw magic: 500 mana and room for 3 upgrades.\n\n§fEvolve it with a Tome of Arcana to reach the higher tiers.
ws.hb.e.r_loom.body=§fThe bench where you bind spells to a wand and recharge its mana.\n\n§fThe base is plain Stone, not Cobblestone. Place it on the ground and use it holding the wand you want to work on.
ws.hb.e.r_silk.body=§fThread spun around a magic crystal. Every piece of wizard clothing starts here.
ws.hb.e.r_flask.body=§fBottled mana, for recharging a wand at the Arcane Loom.\n\n§fThis is the Small Flask, worth 250 mana. Whole Magic Crystals instead of shards give the Medium; Grand Crystals give the Large.
ws.hb.e.r_scroll.body=§fAn empty sheet waiting for an incantation. Combine it with magical items to write a spell into it.\n\n§fShapeless - the two go in any slots.
ws.hb.e.r_handbook.body=§fThis very book.\n\n§fShapeless - the two go in any slots.
